{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104170","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1910417001:1":{"text":"칼릭스, 쟤가... 네 동생이야?","source_cn":"卡律先生，他……是你的弟弟？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05936302DD969D52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910417002:1":{"text":"你们两个长得一点也不像……和我们家完全不一样，好奇怪……你们深海裔都是这样吗？","source_cn":"你们两个长得一点也不像……和我们家完全不一样，好奇怪…...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x6E8D43A6B8A5C951","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910417003:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1910417003":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910417004:1":{"text":"아, 미안... 저기, 넌 이름이 뭐야?","source_cn":"啊，不好意思……那个，你叫什么名字？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10010DD82ADBCADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910417005:1":{"text":"歌尼特……","sourc